Next, you see if this actor has a TargetComponent. The way you can check this for now is to
find if any TargetComponent in mTargetComps has an owner corresponding to the actor
that you collide against. You can optimize this significantly after you implement a method
to figure out which components an actor has; you will do this in Chapter 14, “Level Files and
